msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Quick Start Guide\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to the Quick Start Guide! This guide will help you quickly get started with our product. Please follow the steps below to begin your journey.\n"
"\n"
"## Step 1: Installation\n"
"\n"
"First, you need to install the software. Run the following command in your terminal:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"npm install your-package-name\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Step 2: Configuration\n"
"\n"
"After installation, you need to configure the settings. Create a configuration file and add the necessary parameters:\n"
"\n"
"```javascript\n"
"const config = {\n"
"  apiKey: \"your-api-key\",\n"
"  endpoint: \"https://api.example.com\",\n"
"  retryCount: 3\n"
"};\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Step 3: Usage\n"
"\n"
"Once configured, you can start using the product. Here is a basic example:\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"from your_package import Client\n"
"\n"
"client = Client(api_key=\"your-api-key\")\n"
"result = client.query(\"Hello, world!\")\n"
"print(result)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Step 4: Troubleshooting\n"
"\n"
"If you encounter any issues, please refer to the FAQ section or contact our support team.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"We hope you enjoy using our product! For more detailed information, please check the full documentation.\n"

msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, used for efficient kernel auto-tuning, operator compilation, and deployment. By being compatible with Triton core syntax and performing deep optimization for Ascend NPU features, it helps users quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

msgid "本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法实例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr "This document uses the deployment of a vector addition example via software package installation in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment as an example to guide users in quickly getting started with **Triton-Ascend**. For more installation methods, please refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) document."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

msgid "支持的操作系统：linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2/A3/950系列"
msgstr "Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2/A3/950 series"

msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr "Minimum hardware configuration: single card with 32GB memory (recommended)"

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。其中，可以参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》 完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine the CANN, Python, and TorchNPU software versions and install them. For the driver and firmware installation, refer to the \"[CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\" guide on the Ascend community official website."

msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

msgid "Python版本：python3.11"
msgstr "Python version: python3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility details, please refer to the [Version Compatibility Matrix](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Start Installation"

msgid "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi\\n"
msgstr "pip install triton-ascend --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "**运行tutorials中向量加法实例验证结果**"
msgstr "**Run the vector addition example in tutorials to verify the results**"

msgid "向量加法实例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr "Vector addition example: [01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) demonstrates that the Ascend NPU device can correctly invoke Triton operators and ensure computational accuracy by comparing the output results of Triton operators with those of PyTorch native computation."

msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在 bash 环境下执行。若使用 POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr "⚠️ The following commands need to be executed in a bash environment. If using POSIX sh, replace `source` with `.`."

msgid "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)\\n"
msgstr "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)"

msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr "Observing similar output indicates that the environment configuration is correct."

msgid "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\\n"
msgstr "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')"
